OL,3,GNEWSAPlanned Gibraltar-sized rail
OL,4,Atesting centre has cost taxpayers #70m
OL,5,Abut hasn't been built
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe future of a proposed rail-testing
OL,8,Fcentre that has received #70m of
OL,9,Ftaxpayers' money but still has not been
OL,10,Fbuilt is to be decided by the Welsh
OL,11,Fgovernment.
OL,13,FThe Global Centre of Rail Excellence
OL,14,F(GCRE) has not found the private-sector
OL,15,Ffunding it needs as the risk is "too
OL,16,Fgreat" for potential investors, its
OL,17,Fboss has said.
OL,19,FLaunched five years ago, the project is
OL,20,Fbased at the former Nant Helen opencast
OL,21,Fcoal mine near Ystradgynlais, Powys.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
