OL,3,GNEWSAPlanned Gibraltar-sized rail
OL,4,Atesting centre has cost taxpayers #70m
OL,5,Abut hasn't been built
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinisters are now being asked to
OL,8,Fapprove plans for a data centre there,
OL,9,Fwhich GCRE hopes will attract more
OL,10,Ffunding for the rail project.
